---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Anonymous feedback · Five Minutes" description="Send private, anonymous feedback about Five Minutes.">
  <article class="feedback-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Private reader feedback</p>
    <h1>Send anonymous feedback</h1>
    <p class="lede">Report a problem or suggest an improvement. Your message is saved privately for the site owner and authorised AI workers to consider.</p>

    <form class="feedback-form card" data-feedback-form>
      <label for="feedback-category">What is this about?</label>
      <select id="feedback-category" name="category" required>
        <option value="bug">Something is broken</option>
        <option value="enhancement">An improvement or new idea</option>
        <option value="content">A lesson or its content</option>
        <option value="other">Something else</option>
      </select>

      <label for="feedback-message">Your message</label>
      <textarea id="feedback-message" name="message" minlength="10" maxlength="2000" rows="8" required aria-describedby="feedback-help"></textarea>
      <p id="feedback-help" class="form-help">10–2,000 characters. Please do not include personal or confidential information.</p>

      <div class="feedback-honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
        <label for="feedback-website">Website</label>
        <input id="feedback-website" name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
      </div>

      <div class="turnstile-slot" data-turnstile-widget aria-label="Abuse-prevention verification"></div>
      <button class="button" type="submit" data-feedback-submit disabled>Send feedback</button>
      <p class="feedback-status" data-feedback-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Preparing secure feedback…</p>
      <noscript><p class="feedback-status" data-kind="error">JavaScript is required to verify and send feedback.</p></noscript>
    </form>

    <section aria-labelledby="feedback-privacy">
      <h2 id="feedback-privacy">What is saved</h2>
      <p>Five Minutes asks only for a category and message. It does not ask for your name or email address, add analytics, or attach your IP address, browser details or reading history to the saved feedback.</p>
      <p>Cloudflare processes the request and abuse-prevention check. GitHub stores the resulting message as a private issue. Infrastructure providers may process normal connection metadata under their own policies.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
  <script>import '../lib/feedback';</script>
</BaseLayout>
